rd/Getty Images 来自 Getty Images 北美&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;当购物者使用 Phia 的产品进行购买时，该公司会从零售商那里赚取佣金，以帮助推动销售。但 Phia 的浏览器扩展程序还旨在报告该初创公司即使在其产品从未使用过的情况下也推动了销售—— &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/0eGTnC7woVBoWjt-sal3Tm8Pbu7eN5DRwdX1t0YtZvfBArPFCsstwueV5DG10Fq07x4r3aRT59nhRaLJdJNY7dqwCnEmGNf6-j6L0tIMvsjy_kXQudIUNheG2phtjMCogEjNz7a93BN9mnXagC76AUFYEp8-HhVPSLXUtcZnoLCjO_p-YylUx97Nc_Y1OyH2q4MWQ7kuKZ5MyvuDUa0ar1r-pf4uMKf3Q2x4kk6rnL4fCtrYE01JOeHnrhjtfjpht-S165h0_V4VNIigj1wxwbHG4xYfK-Wm8fU0nRvj7tJendpjY-12onczdd2V2qbbMN2lK8uA9zMmgBWq0n1QccXTYwjnOtfrPjWMyF-uohqHinn_ULyj5kUUZ-hLwK7DN5-Hs-YmAyG6OzLkWJYDWhzf_ujQXMYvBFIeJmt6QLb47TynDCyaKNqhbYD_wjOKdotMdD1oZKJHfR_-nBIKvxgES_e7HNM7C52iYSUEXxogBg1ql3ZgmJlhYaR9i1e4l6C7dkORcHqYs9zPcMineK8W9QpWvw/uw-BZf7M7SXQq9DW1wkhebZecBif5YDl/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="盖茨继承人的购物应用程序声称其并未推动销售"&gt;据彭博社 7 月报道&lt;/a&gt;，这种做法导致佣金增加。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;现在看来，菲亚联合创始人菲比·盖茨（比尔·盖茨的女儿）和索菲亚·基安尼&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/yJWujhJP2ZSSNb7UYNsNfJPBOv5V_na5ezAfLzYe-4KJk2lLK93kmhT8MgdxE7vEETmFMc8FYJ4CzGCSNZGvkdK_63oW4j9FL15E-TXyOtVwhf9WB8FwjUVrPknUBGDvrzXVDpI9DPkkVgk_-gBir7W3I4XxVnV7SDb1XIoOHzuJT3mw-Fj8cx5oUWek9iKmEQpZP8Y_n71yLsNnWeRme5RdHIwZSVJ9Ji1eH-dBNNmYwWM7jWzbDS3gcPuLL2IZDjFORa6abm4XOjcUpmkmcoDMnsVIBaQKwQF3JybNGcnPb-fBF--ewHG9MMe0nabFO5vvQ2BRLaztTVhaPnFuJYV3PN3C-cBkEQACkOcZE-slwMqwL1OebzOM16_LTR83VcgM0JL3YBiZqIAkXjPvcB0aA87iy_6WdzQAClKBfTYcijRuzkVO92xdxLunPrlzmEBU28TrwzRkofZJ4N6uAYcJZveZo6x32KwaHWoHU-OK780C6qrqHfdbXqZk2qvnZE6ThhgCi4QAfv1249EUwR0EJd-QMSgE8JUPK7pWvfS50dq2BsGd/riiozR3Bn6kvLSJ7XLLeaj_Q6QYDL-9_/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="菲比·盖茨 (Phoebe Gates) 知道 Phia 购物应用程序将其未推动的销售归功于自己"&gt;据说推动了这些功能&lt;/a&gt;。 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style="margin: 20px 0; background-color: #f5f5f5; border-radius: 12px; padding: